From 38987c5e6513b10af48f930df9f92d87bbb332f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: airidosas252 <airidaslideikis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:32:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 06/20] tu: Extend the native A8XX mesh path

 - Fragment shaders that read gl_Layer or gl_ViewportIndex: the mesh
   shader also writes the value into the per-primitive record. Layer and
   viewport now work for lines too.
 - 64-bit and matrix per-primitive outputs.
 - DERIVATIVE_GROUP_QUADS: swizzled quad flattening of the local id.
   Advertise meshAndTaskShaderDerivatives with the native path.
 - Prune vertex slots that neither the FS nor the mesh shader reads when
   there are more than 32.
 - Read gl_DrawID from SP_SHARED_CONSTANT_GFX[0x47], as the proprietary
   driver does, instead of a per-draw UBO.
 - Re-emit compute state only after a native mesh draw in the same command
   stream, instead of on every dispatch once any mesh pipeline exists.
 - Don't call nir_opt_varyings_bulk with an empty shader list. This
   happened when a mesh library link had a cached FS.

VK-CTS on Adreno 840 (KGSL), TU_EXPERIMENTAL=mesh_shader,mesh_native:
  dEQP-VK.spirv_assembly.instruction.compute.compute_shader_derivatives.mesh.*
                                                  181 pass, 0 fail, 2 not supported
  ...compute_shader_derivatives.task.*            181 pass, 0 fail, 2 not supported
    (all not supported before)
  dEQP-VK.mesh_shader.ext.api.draw_indirect*      428 pass, 0 fail, 109 not supported
  dEQP-VK.mesh_shader.ext.in_out.32_bits_only / with_i64: 160 cases now take the
    native path and pass
  dEQP-VK.mesh_shader.ext.pipeline.* and smoke.* run to completion in one
    process (two optimized_lib cases crashed the process before)
